00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
So people always ask why I chose Biote.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.580
I used to work ER and ICU trauma for 18 years,

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.330
and I would help write protocols for the ER and ICU

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:16.340
for things like Code Cool or sepsis.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.100
And those are all research-based,
and this is also research-based.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.540
So it's not me guessing about what you need.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:29.870
There's a full panel, a very detailed hormone check,

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.580
and all your labs are checked,
your thyroid's checked, everything.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.100
And then we put it into the computer,
and it gives you the results that you need

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.240
based on your symptoms, based on your history.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.560
It is not just a guessing game.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:48.060
So it's very detailed, and it's research-based,
and it is what works for you.
